  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific Women Lead</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Pacific Women Lead is Australia&apos;s leading regional investment in gender equality in the Pacific. This program builds on Pacific Women Shaping Pacific Development and follows locally-led development principles. The program focusses on strengthening gender equality throughout the Pacific region through focussing on women&apos;s leadership and rights, including safety, health, economic empowerment and responding to and preventing family and gender-based violence. Pacific Women Lead also focusses on strengthening regional architecture and increasing effectiveness of regional gender equality efforts through working with SPC, UN agencies, and civil society, specifically Pacific Women&apos;s organisations.</narrative>
  </description>
